{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38665","headline":"喜杜荀鹤及第 · 李昭象","name":"喜杜荀鹤及第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深岩贫复病，榜到见君名。\n贫病浑如失，山川顿觉清。\n一春新酒兴，四海旧诗声。\n日使能吟者，西来步步轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昭象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}